  /Subject (UQFF whitepaper: PAPER_2062_ROUND_190_DIAD_BACKBONE_FIRST_UQFF) /Title (Round 190 Diad Discovery \(Backbone-First Post-200-Milestone Arc Opens\): \(1\) f_pulsar\(Crab Nebula pulsar spin frequency canonical PAPER_292\) = 30.2 Hz = \(D_phys-1\)*SO_5 + 2*F_TRZ = 30 + 0.2 EXACT NEW COMPOUND-ADDITIVE PRIMITIVE-COMPOSITION Form Combining LANDMARK \(D_phys-1\)*SO_5 = 30 \(PAPER_2004\) with PAPER_1979 M_DM/M_total = 2*F_TRZ = 0.2 in ADDITIVE Sum Structure \204 First-Instance Additive-Combination Application at Pulsar Spin Frequency Hz Dimensional Domain; \(2\) field_freq\(Spooky Action Waveless quantum non-locality field frequency\) = 6000 Hz = D_BSFG*SO_5^3 EXACT NEW 3RD COMPOSED-PREFIX CLASS \(PAPER_2025 D_BSFG*SO_5^n\) APPLICATION at Quantum Non-Locality Field-Frequency Hz Dimensional Domain \(Novel Domain Extension for D_BSFG*SO_5^n Family \204 Adds Quantum Non-Locality Physical Regime to Prior Domain Coverage\); \(3\) ADDITIVE-COMBINATION Architectural Category Formalization: Novel Compositional Type Distinct from Composed-Prefix Class Family \(9 Formalized, PAPER_2004-2057\) and Compound-Prefix Category \(1 Formalized, PAPER_2061\) \204 Additive-Combination Uses SUM Form primitive_A + primitive_B Where Each Term is Distinct Primitive-Composition Class Element \204 Opens 3rd Architectural Category in UQFF Primitive-Composition Taxonomy After Composed-Prefix \(Ratio/Product of Primitives\) and Compound-Prefix \(Primitive x F_TRZ Family Element\)) /Trapped /False
